abstract: >-
  Software, aggregate results, paper materials, and verification workflows for
  frozen-origin validation of the Compensability Capacity Assessment across
  Q1-Q4 2022 and Q1-Q4 2023, weekly-to-annual horizons, and compensation-timing
  outcomes including thirty-day relief and relief-days. Exact row-level
  reproduction requires authorized data access.
